WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.096
In this lesson, you will learn to plan a path through a maze, avoiding walls, and find a short way.

2
00:00:10.696 --> 00:00:14.539
In a maze, walls block the way.

3
00:00:14.539 --> 00:00:19.252
Bump into one and you have to start again.

4
00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:25.000
Trace the path with your finger before you add blocks.

5
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:31.617
Each straight part of the path is one block with a number.

6
00:00:32.217 --> 00:00:35.191
Is there a shorter way?

7
00:00:35.191 --> 00:00:37.730
Fewer blocks is smarter.

8
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:43.478
Help the mouse through the maze to the cheese (star).

9
00:00:43.478 --> 00:00:47.757
Through the twists and turns — cheese time!

10
00:00:48.357 --> 00:00:52.200
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:57.348
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
